WEBVTT

00:09:58.761 --> 00:10:00.804
and that was a struggle for my family,

00:10:00.846 --> 00:10:03.682
trying to support him
and stay close to him,

00:10:03.724 --> 00:10:06.644
but also move on
with our day-to-day lives.

00:10:07.061 --> 00:10:08.646
And for 14 years,

00:10:08.687 --> 00:10:11.732
I didn't say a word to my coworkers.

00:10:11.732 --> 00:10:13.817
And that was a secret that took a toll.

00:10:14.526 --> 00:10:16.070
When he was finally released,

00:10:16.070 --> 00:10:19.782
he was so motivated
to find employment near his home,

00:10:19.823 --> 00:10:21.158
near his family.

00:10:21.450 --> 00:10:24.495
But he couldn't find anybody
that would employ him.

00:10:25.371 --> 00:10:28.082
Eventually, he did find an employer

00:10:28.082 --> 00:10:30.584
that saw past the worst thing
he'd ever done